flowchart TD
    A[Proposed work order or material action] --> K{Kill switch active?}
    K -->|Yes| STOP[Stop and record escalation]
    K -->|No| Q{Requirement valid,<br/>owned, fresh, and undisputed?}
    Q -->|No| STOP
    Q -->|Yes| S{Within approved files,<br/>tools, limits, and purpose?}
    S -->|No| STOP
    S -->|Yes| R{Risk and protected-action classification}

    R -->|Trivial or low risk<br/>not protected| AUTO[Autonomous path]
    R -->|Medium or high risk| OWNER[Owner review required]
    R -->|Contract / legal| OWNER
    R -->|External spend| OWNER
    R -->|Secrets or security policy| OWNER
    R -->|Destructive data change| OWNER
    R -->|Production promotion| OWNER
    R -->|Execution-policy authority expansion| OWNER

    AUTO --> V{Independent verification,<br/>exact-head CI, clean scope,<br/>evidence, rollback all pass?}
    V -->|No and repair available| REPAIR[Return to Worker<br/>within retry budget]
    REPAIR --> V
    V -->|No: unsafe or exhausted| STOP
    V -->|Yes| MERGE[Promoter may merge]

    OWNER --> D{Patrick Craven decision}
    D -->|Approve with valid conditions| V
    D -->|Revise| REPAIR
    D -->|Hold / reject| STOP

    classDef decision fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef auto fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef owner fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#1D4ED8,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef stop fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#0F172A,stroke-width:2px;
    class K,Q,S,R,V,D decision;
    class AUTO,MERGE auto;
    class OWNER owner;
    class STOP stop;
